# Build / release artifacts. Under Candidate C these are generated, not authored.
dist/

# Local experiment scratch. Experiment RECORDS are committed (adapters/**/*.md);
# raw scratch output is not, because it is the most likely place for an accidental
# environment dump to appear.
.experiment-scratch/

# Local development virtual environment. Never committed.
.venv/
venv/

# Output from the Q-IMPL-007 probe fixture. Written during a manual host run; the
# RESULT is recorded in docs/m3-host-runbook.md, and the raw file is not committed --
# a stale probe artifact in the tree would read as evidence of a run that is over.
.probe-output/
